sispmctl (4.11-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * QA upload.

  * Updated Standards-Version from 4.6.2 to 4.7.0.
  * Use wrap-and-sort -at for debian control files.
  * Replaced obsolete pkg-config build dependency with pkgconf.
  * Trim trailing whitespace.
  * Use secure URI in debian/watch.
  * Corrected Appstream metainfo and rename to reverse DNS ID based filename.

